<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11909"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:rwmm@swbell.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilymarie<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, March 20, 2005 - 7:40 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Scott Peterson and Dennis Rader were treated as girls by their mothers? How could anyone possibly know that about either one of them - as a fact? The items found in Dennis&#39; treasure trove were trophies from his victims - mostly females. He wasn&#39;t a cross dressing dog catcher...he was overflowing with testerone and narcissism.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
